<section class="ctce-section" id="how-it-works"><p class="ctce-kicker">Ready for your next calling block</p><h2>Install it. Open the sidebar. Find your script.</h2>
<ol class="ctce-steps"><li><span class="ctce-number">01</span><h3>Add it to Chrome</h3><p>Open the official store listing in desktop Chrome. Select <strong>Add to Chrome</strong> and confirm the installation.</p></li><li><span class="ctce-number">02</span><h3>Open your side panel</h3><p>Find CallTeam Cold Call Script Picker in Chrome’s Extensions menu. Pin it for easy access, then select its icon beside your dialer or CRM tab.</p></li><li><span class="ctce-number">03</span><h3>Choose your next line</h3><p>Search for a buyer, industry or keyword. Pick a script, copy an opener and expand an objection reply when you need it.</p></li></ol></section>

<section class="ctce-section ctce-example" id="script-example"><div><p class="ctce-kicker">One practical example</p><h2>Calling an IT leader about security?</h2><p>Search for <strong>cybersecurity IT director</strong>. Choose the risk assessment script and read the opening question before you dial.</p><p>If the buyer says their MSP handles security, open the matching objection response. Adapt the wording to your own offer and listen to the answer.</p><p>The full script page adds buyer roles, qualification questions and follow-up context.</p><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/cybersecurity-risk-assessment-cold-call-script/">Read the cybersecurity call script →</a></div>
<div class="ctce-example-panel"><small>Example from the included script library</small><div class="ctce-example-query">Search: cybersecurity IT director</div><h3>The opening question</h3><blockquote>“When was the last time an independent team tested whether the controls would actually hold up during an incident?”</blockquote><details open><summary>“Our MSP handles security.”</summary><p>“That is fine—we often complement MSPs. The question is whether the same provider operating the environment should also be the only party validating it.”</p></details></div></section>

<section class="ctce-section" id="features"><p class="ctce-kicker">What you get</p><h2>Practical B2B scripts within reach.</h2><div class="ctce-features"><div class="ctce-feature"><h3>Find the right conversation</h3><p>Search across 110 cold calling scripts by buyer, industry or keyword. Choose the example that fits your offer and the person you are calling.</p></div><div class="ctce-feature"><h3>Copy the wording you need</h3><p>Use an opener, objection reply or full talk track. Replace names and placeholders with your details before using it.</p></div><div class="ctce-feature"><h3>Keep your working tab open</h3><p>The side panel sits beside your CRM or dialer in desktop Chrome. It does not connect to those tools or make calls for you.</p></div><div class="ctce-feature"><h3>Go deeper when you need to</h3><p>Open the matching CallTeam page for targeting notes and follow-up questions. Use our <a href="/cold-call-script-checker/">free Script Checker</a> to review your own opening.</p></div></div></section>

